    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="fc7b2704-046f-5ea7-9e9f-790a2440c5be" activityNameId="5a23feb3-0f61-5492-a0f7-8be0fe62a5c0" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Silicone product, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Silicone product, at plant
Average of about 2000 products. The inventory has been calculated as a weighted mean of two production facilities which produce both a range of different products. ;
Synonyms: chlorosilanes, polydimethylsiloxane, RTV-1 silicone rubber sealants, silicic acid esters, hyperpure silicon, silicones, silanes, silica, organics, cyclodextrins, vinyl polymers; 
UUID: 2af6f466-f68e-3e06-bd94-34152d38b326
Gate to gate inventory for the production of average silicon products.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Integrated chemical processing facilities with 150 different factories, e.g. electric furnace, silane distillation, hydrolysis, storage tanks, etc.
Time period: Reporting time of environmental reports.
Production volume: About 0.7Mio. tonnes in 2000
Sampling: Environmental reports for 2 plants. 
Extrapolations: Average data for a range of products
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2af6f466-f68e-3e06-bd94-34152d38b326.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
